                    <fd:scripts fd:init="[{\"script\":{\"field\":\"this\"\\,\"event\":\"Initialize\"\\,\"model\":{\"nodeName\":\"EVENT_SCRIPTS\"}\\,\"content\":\"TXT_BankingRelationship1.value = '0319';\\\\nTXT_BankingRelationship1.enabled = false;\"}\\,\"nodeName\":\"SCRIPTMODEL\"\\,\"version\":1\\,\"enabled\":true}]" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                  <textdraw_slot2_da69bf97bbe24922891305ea1af882b7 _value="<p><b>UBS Europe SE</b></p>\n" alwaysInPdf="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" dorHeaderSlot="slot2" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_HeaderSlot2" showIfHidden="true" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" summaryExclusion="true" textIsRich="true" visible="{Boolean}false">
              <panel_cd1367ad2e7745c0b3d66c8c3ee35f75 dorExcludeDescription="true" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guidePanel" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="PN_337e9218" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/panel" textIsRich="true" validateOnStepCompletion="{Boolean}false">
                <items jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" sling:resourceType="fd/af/layouts/gridFluidLayout2">
                  <textdraw_cb8d7ce3775d4628804d2f113ad290f5 _value="<p>A partnership as well as &#39;grantor&#39; or &#39;simple&#39; trust will have to satisfy all the following conditions:</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_APartnershipAsWellAsGrantorOr_6fe404fd" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_c15b5ad549464f4e8d5d83d8f3083ffe _value="<ul style=\"list-style-type: \"\\2013\";\"><li>The partnership or trust is a direct account holder of UBS;</li><li>The account holder is a certified deemed-compliant FFI (other than a registered deemed-compliant Model 1 IGA FFI)<sup>1</sup>, an exempt beneficial owner, an owner-documented FFI or an NFFE (other than a Withholding partnership or trust).</li><li>None of the partners, beneficiaries or owners is a US person;</li><li>None of the partners, beneficiaries or owners are flow-through entities or acting as intermediaries; and</li><li>None of the partners, beneficiaries or owners is subject to FATCA withholding or reporting<sup>2</sup>.</li></ul>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_ThePartnershipOrTrustIsA_d27ccee9" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_703670c1a06547cd8ff1c883ff38974a _value="<p>The QI must withhold tax at the highest rate applicable to any partner, beneficiary, or owner.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_TheQiMustWithholdTaxAtThe_eccdf07c" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_1a8d93247b8a4567be031914b89aa6d0 _value="<p>In order to comply with the above conditions, the following specific QI documents are required from the partnership or trust:</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_InOrderToComplyWithTheAbove_fa7008f0" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_d6af37fbfef0453fbd875858515c1448 _value="<ul style=\"list-style-type: \"\\2013\";\"><li>Withholding Statement and Agreement; and</li><li>Substitute Form W-8IMY from the partnership or trust; and</li><li>Official Form W-8BEN from each of the partners, beneficiaries or owners that are individuals; and/or</li><li>Official Form W-8BEN-E from each of the partners, beneficiaries or owners that are entities.</li></ul>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_WithholdingStatementAnd_377d9431" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_378e724373bc47928f5459560f9a6aba _value="<p>Please note that the above documents are kept within the bank and are not forwarded to the Internal Revenue Service.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_PleaseNoteThatTheAbove_9758b0fe" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_3be535b44c5f43caaf5a5893b4eea358 _value="<p>Under the Withholding Statement and Agreement, the partnership or trust must make records available within 90 days upon request from</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_UnderTheWithholdingStatement_5f764277" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_6db64b03d62642b0a08deb2d189228f3 _value="<p>QI or QI&#39;s auditor. If the partnership or trust fails to comply with the request within the time limit, this might result in correction of withholding and disclosure of the partnership or trust and its partners, beneficiaries or owners to the US Internal Revenue Service.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_QiOrQiSAuditorIfThe_30444fd6" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_dd309b8808d843ddac573bb0f62b5087 _value="<p>The Substitute Form W-8IMY and agreement are in general valid without timely restriction. Other documentation such as Forms W-8BEN and/or W-8BEN-E, withholding statements, and related documentation are subject to a renewal based on applicable rules, and unless there are material changes which will require a renewal. We appreciate that the QI rules are complicated. If you are not familiar with the QI rules, please seek advice from your own legal counsels for the appropriate action that you should take.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_TheSubstituteFormW8imyAnd_e174e105" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_39646503c0ec4baeb8abe8dfad619a27 _value="<p>The information provided in this document is based on the current legal and/or tax laws as applicable at the point in time when this information was prepared. Such legal and/or tax situation may change subsequently. Please note that all legal and/or tax considerations and indications included in or deriving from the information provided in this document should only be considered as non-binding, general information. In no circumstance must such considerations and indications be understood as a substitute for having obtained appropriate legal and/or tax advice as provided by your certified legal and/or tax counsel. Only such counsel will be able to finally and comprehensively analyze your specific case and to take fully into account your individual situation. UBS Europe SE must not provide legal and or tax advice.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_TheInformationProvidedInThis_31697381" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
                  <textdraw_8ac7376771df43b79e48ca9e6b58ae21 _value="<p>UBS Europe SE is a subsidiary of UBS AG, Switzerland. Please note that this document must neither be copied nor distributed without having obtained the prior written approval from UBS Europe SE.</p>" css="" dorFieldStyling="Default" guideNodeClass="guideTextDraw" jcr:created="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:createdBy="blueprint" jcr:lastModified="{Date}<DATE>" jcr:lastModifiedBy="blueprint" jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" name="ST_UbsEuropeSeIsASubsidiaryOfUbs_fb6dd43c" sling:resourceType="ajila-forms-customers/ajila-forms-ubs/components/controls/textdraw" textIsRich="true">
                    <fd:rules jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                    <cq:responsive jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured">
                      <default jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured" offset="0" width="12">
